WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.150
Hi there!

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:04.067
When an employee buys something with their own money,

00:00:04.017 --> 00:00:06.270
or drives their own car to meet a supplier,

00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:08.430
the company has to pay them back correctly.

00:00:08.766 --> 00:00:10.430
This lesson covers two things:

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.559
entering a receipt paid with your own money, and making a travel claim,

00:00:14.509 --> 00:00:17.710
so Tositeo calculates the per diems and the mileage for you.

00:00:18.348 --> 00:00:21.479
On the Overview page, click Paid with own money.

00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:25.399
The Add receipt page opens, with Own money already selected.

00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:29.639
Snap the receipt and fill it in as usual, then send it for approval.

00:00:29.969 --> 00:00:33.641
Once the receipt is approved, the amount goes to the reimbursement list,

00:00:33.591 --> 00:00:36.759
and is paid to the IBAN in the profile of the person who paid.

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:38.688
Now for travel claims:

00:00:38.843 --> 00:00:41.648
open Travel claims, and click New travel claim.

00:00:42.077 --> 00:00:44.528
Fill in the Name of the trip, and the Purpose:

00:00:44.637 --> 00:00:46.048
who you met, and why.

00:00:46.477 --> 00:00:49.888
Choose when you left from home or work, and when you arrived back.

00:00:50.317 --> 00:00:52.288
The trip length decides the allowance:

00:00:52.579 --> 00:00:57.088
over six hours gives a partial per diem, over ten hours a full per diem.

00:00:57.705 --> 00:01:00.537
For a trip abroad, choose the Destination country.

00:01:00.965 --> 00:01:04.457
Tositeo has per diem rates for more than two hundred countries.

00:01:04.885 --> 00:01:09.047
If two meals were covered, for example included in a ticket or hotel,

00:01:08.997 --> 00:01:10.537
or offered by a customer,

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.217
enter the number of days here.

00:01:12.566 --> 00:01:14.697
The per diem is halved automatically.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:19.633
In the Route section, enter the starting point, every stop, and the end point,

00:01:19.583 --> 00:01:21.750
with the kilometres driven to each one.

00:01:22.137 --> 00:01:23.910
Click Add stop if you need one.

00:01:24.247 --> 00:01:25.190
Choose the Vehicle.

00:01:25.605 --> 00:01:29.205
If you're carrying colleagues on work business, pulling a trailer,

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:30.550
or carrying a heavy load,

00:01:30.739 --> 00:01:32.230
choose it here to get a supplement.

00:01:32.831 --> 00:01:37.046
Train tickets, hotels, or other trip costs you paid with your own money:

00:01:37.315 --> 00:01:38.966
tick them under Receipts for this trip.

00:01:39.315 --> 00:01:41.446
The calculation below updates right away:

00:01:41.606 --> 00:01:48.566
here it's one full per diem, 54 €, plus 330 km at 0.55 € per km.

00:01:48.755 --> 00:01:51.526
That's 235.50 € in total.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.206
Click Send for approval.

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:56.986
The travel claim has been sent, and it's Waiting for approval.

00:01:57.307 --> 00:02:00.906
Click PDF to download a printout, to keep with your accounting records.

00:02:01.119 --> 00:02:04.586
Once it's approved, this amount also goes to the reimbursement list.

00:02:05.227 --> 00:02:05.715
Note:

00:02:05.984 --> 00:02:07.715
these official rates are Finland's.

00:02:07.978 --> 00:02:09.630
In Germany or another country,

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:13.155
the business owner enters the allowance rates in Company settings,

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:14.195
as in lesson one.

00:02:14.624 --> 00:02:17.235
Travel claims then use those rates automatically.

00:02:17.502 --> 00:02:20.595
From now on, nobody has to work out allowances by hand.

00:02:20.942 --> 00:02:22.355
Now take the quiz below.
